# ==============================================================================
# Gardner Auction / AF360 Master Administrative Console
# ==============================================================================
# Supabase credentials are configured directly in source code (src/lib/supabase.ts).

# ==============================================================================
# Settlement Email Delivery Provider Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# To deliver actual settlement statements to Gmail or registered email addresses,
# configure either OPTION A (Resend API) or OPTION B (Gmail / Custom SMTP) below.

# --- OPTION A: Resend API (Recommended) ---
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here
# RESEND_FROM=Gardner Auction <settlements@gardnerauction.com>

# --- OPTION B: Gmail SMTP via Google App Password ---
# SMTP_USER=your-account@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your16characterapppass
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_FROM=Gardner Auction Settlements <your-account@gmail.com>
